.TH AMERIKA-FLAVOUR 7 "2026-10-21" "Amerika OS" "Amerika OS Manual"
.SH NAME
amerika\-flavour \- what Amerika OS is, and where its files live
.SH DESCRIPTION
Amerika OS is an Ubuntu flavour: Ubuntu 26.10 ("Stonking Stingray") on ARM64 with the Amerika desktop, which is its own shell on
the KWin compositor (no Plasma shell, no GNOME Shell). It is installed from the signed APT repository
https://www.amerika.social/apt or from the Amerika live image. Only ARM64 is built and tested.
.PP
.IR /etc/os\-release
stays Ubuntu's, so third\-party software that checks for Ubuntu keeps working. The flavour's own identity is in
.IR /usr/share/amerika\-os/flavour ,
an os\-release(5) style file (NAME, VERSION, ID=amerika, BASE_VERSION_ID, CHANNEL, ...).
.SH METAPACKAGES
.TP
.B amerika\-desktop
The standard desktop including Amerika Social, Venture and Office.
.TP
.B amerika\-desktop\-minimal
Session, shell, settings, theme and defaults only.
.TP
.B amerika\-desktop\-full
amerika\-desktop plus LibreOffice, media apps, graphics and developer tools.
.TP
.B amerika\-standard
Command line basics, update channels and unattended upgrades.
.TP
.B amerika\-live
Live image extras (casper, the installer). Not for installed systems.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/amerika\-os/flavour
Flavour identity.
.TP
.I /usr/share/amerika\-os/wallpapers.json
Default wallpapers.
.TP
.I /usr/share/grub/themes/amerika
GRUB theme. Installed but never enabled automatically.
.TP
.I /usr/share/xdg\-desktop\-portal/amerika\-portals.conf
Portal backends for the Amerika session (KDE and GTK).
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/amerika\-mimeapps.list
Default applications for the Amerika session.
.TP
.I /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/52amerika\-unattended\-upgrades
Unattended upgrades from the Amerika repository.
